---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import profile from '../../data/research-profile.json';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Baixin Guo — independent researcher in human-centered AI, feedback, and evaluation" ogImage="/og/about.png">
  <div class="container-content py-16">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">

      <span class="section-label mb-4">About</span>
      <h1 class="mb-2">Baixin <span class="text-[var(--color-primary)] italic">Guo</span> <span class="text-[0.9rem] font-mono font-normal text-[var(--color-text-dim)]">(Max)</span></h1>
      <p class="font-mono text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] mb-8">郭佰鑫· /ˈbaɪ.ʃiːn ˈɡwoʊ/ · bye-sheen gwoh</p>

      <div class="card-static mb-10"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-text)]">{profile.profile}</p></div>
      <h2 class="text-[1.5rem] mb-5">Research question</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed mb-5">{profile.question}</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed mb-5">My psychology background makes me attentive to what a behavioral measure represents. My systems work makes that question concrete: inspect collection mechanisms, test alternative representations, and separate an evaluator's judgment from evidence about an agent's behavior.</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed mb-5">Current collaborations focus on implicit human feedback and memory-agent evaluation. PMD tests whether known-user preference adaptation helps on unseen prompts. Evaluation Runtime makes failures and reporting assumptions inspectable; CheckMyCoach asks how interventions preserve information and affect human decisions.</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed mb-10">I use AI coding tools in research engineering and review specifications, outputs, and evidence boundaries. Software conformance, held-out prediction, and human outcomes answer different questions. <a href="/research/" class="link-arrow">Read the contributions and limits →</a></p>
      <!-- Background -->
      <h2 class="text-[1.5rem] mb-6">Background</h2>
      <div class="space-y-3 mb-10">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-secondary-subtle)] flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-secondary)] font-mono text-[0.5rem] font-bold mt-0.5">B</span>
          <div>
            <strong class="text-[var(--color-ink)]">B.A. in Applied Psychology</strong>
            <span class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)]">— Training in experimental design, statistics (LMM, ANOVA, factor analysis), and psychometrics.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-primary-subtle)] flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-primary)] font-mono text-[0.5rem] font-bold mt-0.5">I</span>
          <div>
            <strong class="text-[var(--color-ink)]">Independent research</strong>
            <span class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)]">(2025–present) — Feedback representation, preference modeling, AI evaluation, and human-centered verification.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-gold-subtle)] flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--color-gold)] font-mono text-[0.5rem] font-bold mt-0.5">F</span>
          <div>
            <strong class="text-[var(--color-ink)]">Domain expertise</strong>
            <span class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)]">— Fitness and sports science (ACSM/NSCA/AHA guidelines), used as the testbed for calibration research due to its accessible safety-critical characteristics.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Prospective Advisors -->
      <h2 class="text-[1.5rem] mb-6">For Prospective Advisors</h2>
      <div class="card-static mb-10">
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed mb-3">
          I am seeking graduate research opportunities in human-centered AI and computer science for Fall 2027, particularly where system design and careful evaluation meet.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed mb-3">
          I am open to research collaboration and RA opportunities in human-centered AI, feedback learning, and agent evaluation.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed">
          <a href="/cv/" class="link-arrow">View CV →</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Beyond the Lab -->
      <h2 class="text-[1.5rem] mb-6">🏀 Beyond the Lab</h2>
      <div class="card-static mb-10">
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          When I'm away from research, you'll find me —        </p>

        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed mb-3">
          <strong>Former student-athlete</strong> — I'm absolutely obsessed with
          basketball 🏀 and soccer ⚽ and I love watching weightlifting 🏋️
          track &amp; field, and wrestling 🤼.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Die-hard fan of <strong>Giannis Antetokounmpo 🇬🇷</strong>
          and <strong>Kylian Mbappé 🇫🇷</strong> .
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Avid reader 📚 — social psychology, behavioral psychology,
          and social ideology.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed">
          In my spare time I follow research on AI / large language models,
          computer science, HCI, and human performance.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Research Interests -->
      <h2 class="text-[1.5rem] mb-6">Research Interests</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <span class="badge">Human-AI Interaction</span>
        <span class="badge">Trust Calibration</span>
        <span class="badge">LLM Evaluation</span>
        <span class="badge">AI Safety</span>
        <span class="badge">Sports Science × AI</span>
        <span class="badge">Experimental Design</span>
        <span class="badge">CSCW</span>
        <span class="badge">Contextual Bandits</span>
        <span class="badge">Open Science</span>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
